{#
  The migrated-content banner.

  Every page using it carries text lifted verbatim from the live
  circulationstudio.com and NOT rewritten. CLAUDE.md forbids generating or
  editing legal and policy language, so the text is transcribed and the
  provenance is stated here rather than in the policy body, where an editorial
  note would read as part of the policy.

  `note` is for a page-specific warning about the migrated text. It is
  provenance, not policy: it says what the text describes and when it was
  written, never what the reader's rights are.
#}
<aside class="cs-migrated" aria-label="Content status">
  <p class="cs-migrated__label">Migrated content, pending review</p>
  <p class="cs-migrated__body">
    This text is carried over verbatim from the previous circulationstudio.com
    and has not been rewritten for this site. It is published so the page is
    not missing, and it is awaiting legal review.{% if note %} {{ note }}{% endif %}
  </p>
</aside>
